<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Rockhound" id="00102abd" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;Arrastra cada roca a su vagón correspondiente y demuestra tu experiencia en minería.&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>00102abd.swf</image><bgimage>DDGh_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="71" onstageheight="63" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="193" onstagey="14" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.2" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T025564E.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>163</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>170</x><y>215</y></point><point><x>371</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>365</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>163</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Yeso</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El yeso está formado por compuestos de sulfato de calcio que se unen en contacto con el agua.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82E71A</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="69" onstageheight="61" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="369" onstagey="26" baseheight="193" basewidth="216" pctstage="32.1" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T048795A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>355</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>361</x><y>226</y></point><point><x>535</x><y>225</y></point><point><x>537</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>355</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Mármol</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El mármol es una roca caliza que ha sido sometida al calor y la presión de la corteza de la Tierra hasta cristalizar.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82715F</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="68" onstageheight="61" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="30" onstagey="15" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="31.9" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T058557A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>226</y></point><point><x>187</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>179</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Lava pahoehoe</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La lava pahoehoe es un tipo de lava basáltica que se solidifica en formas cordadas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82FC0C</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="4" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="77" onstageheight="68" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="445" onstagey="52" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="35.8" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T071380A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>356</x><y>6</y></point><point><x>362</x><y>222</y></point><point><x>533</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>534</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>356</x><y>6</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Gneis</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El gneis se forma cuando ciertas rocas de la corteza terrestre se calientan tanto que los minerales que las forman se separan y cristalizan de nuevo con una estructura en forma de bandas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B829096</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="74" onstageheight="66" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="93" onstagey="76" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="34.5" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T071393A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>185</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>181</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Basalto</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Cuando la lava se enfría para formar el basalto, este puede cristalizar en formas regulares como estas columnas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82909E</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="77" onstageheight="68" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="270" onstagey="68" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="35.8" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T071394A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>177</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>181</x><y>226</y></point><point><x>358</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>358</x><y>6</y></point><point><x>177</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Caliza</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Muchas rocas calizas se han formado por la acumulación de conchas y huesos de animales en el fondo del océano.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82909F</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="73" onstageheight="64" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="194" onstagey="80" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.8" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T071395A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>177</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>183</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>369</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>356</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>177</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Arenisca</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La arenisca está formada por arena (principalmente compuesta de cuarzo) mezclada con otros minerales.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B8290A0</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="8" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="44" onstagewidth="74" onstageheight="49" popwidth="96" popheight="64" onstagex="370" onstagey="99" baseheight="128" basewidth="192" pctstage="39" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T231875A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>355</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>360</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>534</x><y>222</y></point><point><x>535</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>355</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pizarra</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La pizarra se forma cuando ciertas rocas sedimentarias, como las arcillosas, son sometidas al calor y se consolidan en forma de láminas finas y amplias.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82915D</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="9" seq="1" zindex="9" sequence="9"><image inbucketwidth="75" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="72" onstageheight="64" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="15" onstagey="80" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.7" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">T641614A.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>222</y></point><point><x>184</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>181</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Obsidiana</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La obsidiana es vidrio volcánico que se forma cuando el magma (roca fundida) se enfría muy rápidamente. Suele ser negra aunque puede presentarse con manchas más claras (intrusiones de cristobalita, un tipo de cuarzo), como la obsidiana nevada o copo de nieve.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82B2CB</imagerefid><altitems/></item></items><bgimagerefid/><rewards><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Puntuación excelente! ¡Realmente tus neuronas estaban a todo gas!&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle1.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Puntuación genial! ¿Quieres intentarlo de nuevo para superar tu marca?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle2.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Gran esfuerzo! Pero prueba de nuevo... y mejora tu puntuación.&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle3.swf</imagefile></reward></rewards></standardslide></slide></slides><iaigame bucketdirection="horizontal" bucketposx="8" bucketposy="35" stagewidth="534" stageheight="218" bucketwidth="538" bucketheight="90"><resetbuttontext textbuttonstyleid="1">&lt;html&gt;Nuevo intento&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><scorelabeltext textstyleid="3">&lt;html&gt;Puntuación:&lt;/html&gt;</scorelabeltext><matcheslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;aciertos&lt;/html&gt;</matcheslabeltext><trieslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;intentos&lt;/html&gt;</trieslabeltext></iaigame><textstyles><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="center" id="2"/><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="3"/><textstyle size="12" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="4"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="3" align="center" id="5"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="4" align="center" id="6"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="7"/><textstyle size="11" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="8"/></textstyles><textbuttonstyles><textbuttonstyle showbg="0" showoutline="0" basestyleid="5" rollstyleid="5" downstyleid="5" selectedstyleid="5" disabledstyleid="6" basestateid="1" rollstateid="1" downstateid="1" selectedstateid="1" disabledstateid="2" id="1"/></textbuttonstyles><creditsdialogdata bodystyleid="8" titlestyleid="7"><dialogtitle>&lt;html&gt;Créditos&lt;/html&gt;</dialogtitle><text>&lt;html&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Yeso&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dorling Kindersley&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mármol&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Farrell Grenan&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lava pahoehoe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Ray Fairbanks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gneis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Corbis/Lester V. Bergman&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Basalto&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./John Elk&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Caliza&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./Gary Withey&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arenisca&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./John Shaw&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pizarra&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Joyce Photographics&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Obsidiana&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Andrew J. Martinez&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text></creditsdialogdata><colors><color r="137" g="51" b="204" id="1"/><color r="50" g="50" b="50" id="2"/><color r="255" g="255" b="255" id="3"/><color r="228" g="194" b="255" id="4"/><color r="0" g="0" b="0" id="5"/></colors><twocolorbuttonstates><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="3" id="1"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="4" id="2"/></twocolorbuttonstates><twocolorbuttonstyles/></iai>